  "key_finding": "The T41 mediator mass (m_phi ~ 212 MeV) implies Lambda_dark ~ 100-400 MeV for the dark-meson model, very close to the QCD scale. This is consistent with the dark-glueball motivation doc. The T46 mediator mass (m_phi ~ 1.8 GeV) implies Lambda_dark ~ 1.2 GeV for the dark-meson model, or ~ 0.3 GeV for the glueball model. Both are in the QCD-scale regime, not the Planck or electroweak scale. The mediator mass is naturally tied to the dark confining scale, NOT to Planck physics."
